---
description: Apply EngineeringSpec contracts during consequential engineering changes
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @AGENTS.md.

Before modifying code for a consequential change, locate and validate the applicable document under `docs/engineering-specs/`. Inspect affected paths, treat contracts and constraints as binding, and do not claim completion while required verification obligations remain uncovered. Before ending a turn, run `engineeringspec check <spec> --base origin/main --strict`; it checks the complete working state. Fix or escalate violations. Widen approved targets in a contract-only change before implementing against them.
